# How to change these rules

Scope: `implesia-mart-backend` only. Do not apply these rules to `implesia-mart` or other repos.

The standards for this backend are the `.mdc` files in `.cursor/rules/`. Follow them on every change. Do not invent a second standard in chat, comments, or a new doc.

To change a standard, edit the matching file in `.cursor/rules/`. The next session follows the edited file. Keep one concern per file and keep each file short.

If a request conflicts with a rule, follow the rule. Override it only when the user edits the rule or explicitly says to override it for that task.
